     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{45}}{{88}} \\times \\frac{{28}}{{75}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Multiply the numerators and place that in the numerator.</p>\n<p>Multiply the denominators and place that in the denominator.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{45 \\times 28}}{{88 \\times 75}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{1,260}}{{6,600}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Simplify. The GCF of 1,260 and 6,600 is 60.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{\\cancel{{60}} \\times 21}}{{\\cancel{{60}} \\times 110}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{21}}{{110}}\"></span></p>"
    },
